摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Plan, build, and deliver with an open-source, self-hostable AI workspace for coding, collaboration, and automation.","id":"gh:1131734767","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"Wegent","slug":"wecode-ai/Wegent","topics":["agent","ai","chatbot","claude-code","codex","dsh-plugin","wework"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Plan, build, and deliver with an open-source, self-hostable AI workspace for coding, collaboration, "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"d deliver with an open-source, self-hostable AI workspace for coding, collaboration, and automation."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Wegent"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> An open-source AI work system spanning your local desktop, cloud agents, and remote machines."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Wegent includes a desktop workbench and a self-hostable web platform. Wegent Desktop works with loca"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"l projects, files, commands, tests, and code changes. Wegent Web provides browser-based agents, know"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ledge, automation, and administration. Wegent Backend connects these applications to shared project "},{"id":"p5s4","text":"spaces, models, and execution devices."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Download the latest Wegent Desktop · Documentation · Contributing"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Wegent Desktop"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Wegent Desktop organizes local coding work by project and task. The task view keeps the conversation"},{"id":"p8s2","text":", tool activity, tests, changed files, and diffs together; the project-space view provides the board"},{"id":"p8s3","text":", shared files, automation, and execution status."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Running and reviewing a local coding task in Wegent Desktop."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"A project space in Wegent Desktop with its task board, shared files, automation, and execution statu"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"project space in Wegent Desktop with its task board, shared files, automation, and execution status."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- **Desktop workbench** — Organize local projects, tasks, sessions, files, tool activity, tests, and"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" diffs.\n- **Reusable agents** — Combine models, prompts, Skills, knowledge, tools, and collaboration"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" settings.\n- **Project spaces** — Share task boards, files, discussions, automation, execution histo"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ry, and deliveries.\n- **Multiple execution targets** — Run tasks locally, on remote work machines, o"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"r with server-managed executors.\n- **Self-hosting** — Deploy Wegent Web and Backend for team access,"},{"id":"p12s6","text":" APIs, permissions, scheduling, and knowledge services."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Why Wegent"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**The local coding experience built on Codex is the foundation of Wegent Desktop.** It works directl"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"y with the code, files, commands, and development environment in your projects. Connect it to Wegent"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" Backend when coding work needs to move beyond one computer or one person. Once connected, the deskt"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"op workbench and Web use the same projects, tasks, and execution devices."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **Run tasks on the right device** — Keep using the code, files, commands, and development environm"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ent already on a local machine, or run a task for the same project on a remote work machine or serve"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"r-managed executor.\n- **Move a project forward as a team** — Project spaces connect task boards, sha"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"red files, discussions, execution status, and deliveries instead of leaving conversations and code c"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"hanges on separate computers.\n- **Automate repeated project work** — Project spaces can configure au"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"tomation and execution queues to keep routine work moving.\n- **Keep services and data under team con"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"trol** — Self-host Web and Backend for shared access, permissions, model configuration, scheduling, "},{"id":"p15s8","text":"knowledge services, and remote-device management."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"If work always stays on one computer, Wegent Desktop provides a familiar Codex coding experience. Co"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"nnect it to Wegent to extend that experience when tasks must move across people, devices, or a self-"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"to extend that experience when tasks must move across people, devices, or a self-hosted environment."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Wegent Web"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Wegent Web provides the browser interface for remote agents. Agents can use configured models, knowl"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"edge, Skills, and tools while Wegent Backend manages their tasks and execution."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"A Wegent remote agent uses tools to generate a Gantt chart."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Wework is the Wegent desktop workbench. Electron owns desktop windows, system capabilities, and proc"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ess management. DeepSeek Harness (DSH) is the embedded application and plugin runtime, and the Wewor"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"k product UI is composed from a set of DSH plugins. Executor manages tasks and sessions, then drives"},{"id":"p21s4","text":" Codex to perform the actual work in local projects."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"DSH does not execute coding tasks itself. `dsh-app-wework` defines the product shell and extension p"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"oints, `dsh-ui-*` provides the product modules, `dsh-electron-host` bridges restricted Electron capa"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"bilities, `dsh-executor-runtime` communicates bidirectionally with Executor throughout execution, an"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"d `dsh-terminal-runtime` manages local interactive terminals. Executor is the task execution layer, "},{"id":"p23s5","text":"while Codex is the concrete coding agent it drives."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Wework can also connect to Wegent Backend for shared project spaces, models, and remote execution de"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"vices. Wegent Web is a separate browser interface built on the same Backend."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Wegent Desktop"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"1. Download the latest Wegent Desktop installer and install it.\n2. Open the app and add or select a "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"local project.\n3. Create a task and describe the work to perform.\n4. Review the agent activity, comm"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"and output, and file changes."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Wegent Web and Backend"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"To start the self-hosted web application and Backend in standalone mode with Docker:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Open http://localhost:3000 and follow the setup flow to create the administrator password and config"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"ure a model. See the Installation Guide and Standalone Mode for other deployment options."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Requires Node.js 22.15+ (22.x) or 23.8+ (Node.js 24 recommended), and pnpm:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"To run the macOS desktop app:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"See wework/README.md for desktop development, build, and release instructions. `wework/` is the curr"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"ent desktop application source directory."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Repository map"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"### Products and services"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Directory                  | Responsibility                                                  |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"| `wework/`                  | Wegent Desktop (Electron, Vite, React)                          |\n| `"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"wework-mobile/`           | Independent Expo application for iOS and Android                |\n| `fro"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"ntend/`                | Wegent Web (Next.js, React)                                     |\n| `backen"},{"id":"p41s4","text":"d/`                 | Default public API, business logic, and data models             |\n| `backend-r"},{"id":"p41s5","text":"s/`              | Rust hybrid gateway and APIs that have completed migration      |\n| `executor/`  "},{"id":"p41s6","text":"              | Rust task executor, local-device runtime, and Codex integration |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
